The sky turns completely black.

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:11.920
I've awakened me from my slumber.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.220
Look at that thing!

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.100
I've never felt a power like this one.

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:17.560
What are you?

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.060
All right, baby!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.360
On the last episode of Dragon Ball Z, the planet Namek continued to crumble apart as King Kai hatched a plan to restore Frieza's victims back to life.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:50.000
Using a wish to the eternal dragon of the Earth, Mr. Popo made the wish, but it was a tall order, even for an eternal dragon.

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:55.800
And the dragon wasn't sure if he could fulfill the wish or not.

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:59.960
Back on Namek, the showdown continues.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:04.390
between the Super Saiyan Goku and Frieza the Evil Tyrant.

00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:07.640
The Amazing Saiyan continued to challenge

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:09.340
the depths of Frieza's power,

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:11.540
even though the evil giant of strength

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:13.640
was at his maximum power level.

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:15.480
But what's this?

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:17.440
Goku has something up his sleeve?

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:19.880
Well, he's going to need it because Frieza

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:22.120
has committed himself to an all-out attack.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:23.260
Frieza, it's yours!

00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:25.600
The two superpowers are on a crash course,

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:27.560
and it looks like only the strongest

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:29.640
will be able to survive this one.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:15.200
A jolt!

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:18.760
Knock my socks off!

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:23.050
My word, this is truly a battle like no other!

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:27.580
We're running out of time!

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:29.350
What about the wish?

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:29.870
Yeah!

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:33.360
Yes, of course. Mr. Popo is on the job as we speak.

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:38.130
The wish has been made, but Shenron, the Eternal Dragon, is having some trouble.

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:44.100
Fulfilling this wish is no simple task, sir. It's a doozy.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:54.390
My goodness!

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:00.810
AHHHHH!

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:30.600
I don't know what to do.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:05.790
I can't believe it! This is incredible! He's actually gone!

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:18.660
I did it! I won! Yes! No one can beat me! I am lord of the universe!

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:27.620
I hate to say it, Gohan, but if your dad's been defeated, then it's time we get the heck out!

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:28.860
But we still can!

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.520
Gohan?

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.460
You okay? I know it's hard, but we've got to go!

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:47.760
I'm staying, Bulma. You're gonna have to leave with Piccolo.

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:48.160
What?

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.370
I'm part Saiyan, Bulma.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:54.830
